{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52776","headline":"偈 · 怀玉","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清净皎洁无尘垢，莲华化生爲父母。\n我修道来经十劫，出示阎浮厌衆苦。\n一生苦行超十劫，永离娑婆归净土。\n（见《宋高僧传》卷二四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"怀玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}